log "## what this run does NOT establish"
log "   - anything about the other robots"
log "   - steady-state behaviour beyond the ${SETTLE}s settle window"
log "   - whether any observed behaviour is normal for a G1 in general"
log "   - causation for any difference between the two boots"
log ""
log "## scribe notes (append before leaving the room)"
log ""
